# HP40gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# HP40gs boots through the CAS front end, then uses the same Kermit completion
# gate as HP39gs instead of a fixed transfer-duration guess.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
13000 tap home
15000 tap aplet
16000 capture aplet-library
17000 tap f5
18000 capture receive-menu
18500 tap down
19200 tap down
19900 tap down
20200 capture receive-serial-disk
20600 tap enter
40000 capture remote-aplet
41500 tap enter
43000 capture lazy-fetch
44000 host-gate

# Times below are relative to host-gate release. The two ENTER launch sequence
# is preserved; subsequent captures exercise mini/main/editline/control faces.
0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 tap enter
7000 tap enter
19000 capture native-mini
22000 tap enter
25000 capture native-mini-other
28000 tap down
31000 capture native-main
34000 tap enter
37000 capture native-main-other
40000 tap down
43000 capture native-editline
46000 tap enter
49000 capture native-editline-other
52000 tap right
55000 capture generated-control
58000 tap on
